  "name": "desert-neon",
  "vibe": "Vacancy, always. A #241a33 dusk over a sand ridge with sixteen stars twinkling, and a saguaro drawn as three green #59e07a neon tubes wrapped in a 30px halo — the whole cactus drops to 35% opacity whenever the buzz cycle dips, a real gas-tube flicker. A tumbleweed of two dashed rings rolls across at 120px/s while spinning at 160°/s, and a pink #ff7ac2 VACANCY box blinks out of phase with its own bulb. Monoton — hollow, genuinely a neon-sign face — sets uppercase headlines at 0.05em over Outfit, on generous 1.24 leading. It owns Cursor:click, where a pointer walks to a button, ripples, then flips a toggle, and Swipe:flip, a scaleX rolodex through three faces. Titles slam in from 2.2×. Best for road trips, motels, bars and retro Americana.",
